# Control-panel and pre-migration database copies. These were NOT here,
# and the Dockerfile starts with `COPY . .` — so anyone running
# `docker compose up --build` on a machine that had ever taken a backup
# baked their own database into the image. Gitignored, so CI images
# built from a clean checkout were never affected; the person building
# locally is exactly the self-hoster this project is for.
